<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">reload</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Weapons Do Not Need Reloading ━━━</ansi>

If you came here holding a bow or a sling: you do not need this
command. Shooting readies the next round by itself. Just type
<ansi fg="command">fire</ansi> again. See <ansi fg="command">help fire</ansi>.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Administrators ━━━</ansi>

<ansi fg="command">reload</ansi> re-reads a server data file while the game is running,
so content can be edited without a restart.

  <ansi fg="command">reload items</ansi>
      Re-read the item definitions.

  <ansi fg="command">reload biomes</ansi>
      Re-read the biome definitions.

  <ansi fg="command">reload translations</ansi>
      Re-read the language files.

  <ansi fg="command">reload mapcache</ansi>
      Clear the mapper cache. The next map is rebuilt from the
      current room data.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help fire</ansi>
